{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Context</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reunion Island, 1948</strong>. A sudden cyclone forces you to take shelter in a Creole mansion that has been abandoned for years. The temporary refuge quickly turns into a trap as you find yourself caught in a cyclical nightmare, reliving a story of suffering and vengeance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798560/extras/f9e6cb365a50d8289b0889768588a2f1.poster.avif?t=1772103181\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798560/extras/f9e6cb365a50d8289b0889768588a2f1.webm?t=1772103181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798560/extras/f9e6cb365a50d8289b0889768588a2f1.mp4?t=1772103181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into</strong> an old colonial house locked in time and relive the story of <strong>Kalla</strong>, a slave with a tragic fate at the origin of one of <i>Reunion Island</i>\u2019s most terrifying legends: <strong>Gran-M\u00e8r Kal.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Walk </strong>through dark corridors by the light of your flashlight and follow the traces of shadows from the past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect</strong> objects and piece together the fragments of a drama blending folklore, horror, and colonial history.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive</strong> into the depths of a terrifying Creole legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted l